{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00581","headline":"郊庙歌辞 释奠文宣王乐章 雍和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 释奠文宣王乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂献瑶篚，庭敷璆县。\n礼备其容，乐和其变。\n肃肃亲享，雍雍执奠。\n明德惟馨，苹蘩可荐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}